! Pythia8 minimum-bias (inelastic) events for the Delphes pile-up library.
! pp at 13 TeV, SoftQCD:inelastic = non-diffractive + single/double/central diffractive
! (no elastic, so MeanPileUp in the Delphes card = mean number of inelastic interactions).
! Tune and decays: Pythia 8.317 defaults (Monash 2013), the same Pythia8 setup MG5 uses
! for the hard tt̄ events.  The seed is set on the minbias2pileup command line.
Beams:idA = 2212
Beams:idB = 2212
Beams:eCM = 13000.
SoftQCD:inelastic = on

Next:numberCount = 5000
Next:numberShowInfo = 0
Next:numberShowProcess = 0
Next:numberShowEvent = 0
Init:showChangedSettings = on
Init:showChangedParticleData = off
